<details style="margin:22px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#0f766e;">Quick check: What new capability does JavaScript add to this project?</summary>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;">It allows the page to respond to a user's action and change content.</p>
</details>
<div class="figma-footer-line" style="padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">Basics in Webpage Making · Screen 11 of 20</div>
