<div class="figma-page-content" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.62;color:#0f172a;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;">
<h1 class="figma-screen-title">Final Review and Assessment</h1>
<div class="figma-reading-card"><p style="font-size:17px;">The final assessment checks whether you can recognize the roles and connections you used throughout the project. It focuses on the core learning objectives rather than obscure syntax. You should be able to identify HTML structure, connect CSS presentation to that structure, explain a simple event-driven JavaScript interaction, and choose a reasonable first troubleshooting step when the result is not what you expected.</p><p>Complete all questions before checking your score. Read the feedback for any item you miss and return to the corresponding section if needed. A useful review strategy is to explain the project without looking at the code: HTML created the page and interaction targets; CSS established a readable, responsive visual design; JavaScript found the button and message, listened for a click, and changed the page.</p><p>After the assessment, the final screen shows the completed webpage again and provides resources for continuing. Your next learning goal should be small and specific. For example, rebuild this page from a blank file, add one new section, or create a simple form. The strongest sign that you understand the basics is being able to make a small change and explain which layer should contain it.</p></div>
<div class="figma-info-grid" style="">
<div style="flex:1 1 440px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:13px;padding:17px 19px;">
<h2 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px;">Key ideas</h2><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:22px;"><li>Focus on responsibilities and connections.</li><li>Use feedback to revisit a specific weak area.</li><li>Explain the project in your own words.</li><li>Choose a small next challenge rather than jumping immediately to a large application.</li></ul>
</div>
<div style="flex:1 1 360px;background:#ecfeff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;border-radius:13px;padding:17px 19px;">
<h2 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#115e59;">Your task</h2><p style="margin:0;">Complete the eight-question final assessment. If you miss more than two items, revisit the related practice screens and retake it.</p>
</div>
</div>
