<details style="margin:22px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#0f766e;">Quick check: What is the core mental model for the whole module?</summary>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;">HTML provides structure, CSS provides presentation, and JavaScript provides behavior.</p>
</details>
